        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/questor/{size}/2623_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-19T05:51:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi guys,</p><p>Only recently been introduced to SotM, after being very interested by it for quite some time. I love it, and am planning to pick up basically everything as soon as I can get my hands on it. However I am going to be at PAX Aus in a couple of weeks, and notice that &gt;G are also planning to be there - are there likely to be any show specials on the game? I would also happily volunteer to help demo the game, but can't commit to the hours needed for 'official' volunteer status (already have my show badge so wouldn't need payment anyway! :) )</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hope my ramblings make some kind of sense....!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:44.034Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
