        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi guys,</p><p>Only recently been introduced to SotM, after being very interested by it for quite some time. I love it, and am planning to pick up basically everything as soon as I can get my hands on it. However I am going to be at PAX Aus in a couple of weeks, and notice that &gt;G are also planning to be there - are there likely to be any show specials on the game? I would also happily volunteer to help demo the game, but can&#39;t commit to the hours needed for &#39;official&#39; volunteer status (already have my show badge so wouldn&#39;t need payment anyway! :) )</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hope my ramblings make some kind of sense....!</p>",
