        "id": 119485,
        "name": "Theta_Sigma",
        "username": "Theta_Sigma",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-20T01:28:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey!</p><p>Welcome to the forums!</p><p>You are perfectly welcome to hang out with us and volunteer a little of your time. We'll be demo-ing SotM, Sentinel Tactic and Galactic Strike Force. You will also be able to pick up any new promo cards and things that are available. Last year, games were sold at the price they are set on the online store, which makes them a little cheaper than at any game store I've seen. We're also getting a swarm of Mr Chomps!</p><p>We'll be at stall 3022, in the Exhibition Hall. I'll be there almost the entire time, so if you want to talk, look out for someone dressed as Greatest Legacy!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
